      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1312 - Ays ibn al-Qasim reported that He (as) was asked about a man who goes hunting.\nImam (as) said: \"If he is moving around within his vicinity (local area), then he should not shorten his prayer. But if he goes beyond (a specified distance), he should shorten.\""
